WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.360
Every military meeting leaves a record.

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:03.380
Let's talk about it.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.120
Because defence data keeps leaking.

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.990
A Pentagon cloud, maintained with
help from engineers in China.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.040
A payroll contractor:

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:13.280
up to 270,000

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.680
service personnel exposed.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.450
StenoAI runs right at the table.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.980
Parakeet transcribes live,

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.930
in twenty-five languages.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.420
Sortformer tells speakers apart.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.310
A coalition partner's French

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.960
arrives in English.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.430
Gemma 4, on the device,

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:33.190
writes doctrine minutes,

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
with Zulu times and grids.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.400
Every page carries its marking.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:38.750
Defence mode:

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.720
no cloud API,

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.530
no public API,

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.090
no outbound traffic.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:47.080
Nothing leaves until the recorder
signs off,

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.260
with a second officer.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:49.720
You choose where it goes.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.440
It's open source.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.000
Check every line,

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:53.770
and every model.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:55.320
StenoAI.

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:57.090
Lawful command, on the record.
